# Note on tests: there is no Tests/ directory because the toolchain this is
# built with ships neither XCTest nor the swift-testing module, so `swift test`
# cannot run. The suite is an ordinary executable target — Sources/QuotaBarKitTests,
# run with `swift run QuotaBarKitTests`.